Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guitar solo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,H-h-hah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,H-h-hah... Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.82,0:01:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do I find your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:02:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man I thought to be my father turned\Nout to be nothing more than an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything else, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's dangerous to be too trusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.94,0:02:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I decided to get up\Nand shoot you in the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not that trusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kept my finger on the\Ntrigger the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.10,0:02:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now, Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Routine report, date July Thou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two days after the incident\Ncaused by a man named Monev,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tension still runs high in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:03:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The events that occurred there made\Nme realize something all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an awareness which becomes obscured\Nas I keep regular contact with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being the reason Vash the Stampede\Nis called the Humanoid Typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it that so much trouble\Nfalls into this man's lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last December,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,four months ago, we, Meryl\NStryfe and Millie Thompson,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,employees of the Bernardelli\NInsurance Society main office,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were handed down our orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our objective was to make\Ncontact with Vash the Stampede,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man wanted for 60 billion dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,under suspicion of\NClass G property damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upon locating this humanoid typhoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was our mission to minimize any\Ntrouble involving him and bring a quick
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,resolution to situations that had\Nalready started what about bash and why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:03:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you two\Ninnocent-looking things
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are after that 60 billion\Ndouble dollar reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, actually we're just\Npassing through here on business!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Business?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't exactly see him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I could tell, he was\Ngone from the city by dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last I heard, he was\Nheaded out to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me any more about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he stands about 12 fields tall,\Nand he wields a huge weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's supposed to have a\Nmohawk, and nerves of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he's got tons of henchmen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a reputation as the worst\Nwomanizer anyone's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Womanizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.87,0:04:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huge weapon and a mohawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our man, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having obtained information of\Nsomeone matching Vash's description,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we finally achieved contact\Nwith him after three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:05:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Meryl Stryfe, and I'm here representing\Nthe Bernardelli Insurance Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm Millie Thompson!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.58,0:05:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This, uh, is a small\Ntoken of our goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going, Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you here with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The outlaw, Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a lot different from\Nwhat actually happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took a little bit of license\Nto keep it interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Millie, do you want to\Nget a promotion or don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first glance, I must admit, it was\Na bit difficult to tell if it was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was because he didn't\Nact anything like the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,legendary gunman that\NI've heard so much about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, the only thing legendary\Nabout him was his huge appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.50,0:05:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Dang it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:05:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, insurance girls! Snail, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you just leave me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a little make-up kiss, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seemed to be nothing but a\Nvulgar, hopeless troublemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even worse yet, his incorrigible\Nlechery made him an exasperating idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can definitely count on me, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't let anyone in my sights get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm known for my bullets\Nnever missing their mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially if it's the\Nheart of a beautiful lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just remembering what happened\Nthat day gives me chest pains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like my heart's\Ngoing to burst a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought Vash was really funny back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I laughed all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was downright weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, nobody in their right mind\Ncould tell that goofball was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you even think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought it was him from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who refused to believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.26,0:07:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it bother you that much\Nthat I could be right about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, have you finished\Nwriting the papers yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but I'll keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tried to fool us with his perfect\Nportrayal of a good-for-nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dim-witted loser,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it soon became clear to me that his\Nantics were merely part of his little game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to confirm his\Ntrue identity as I watched
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him resolve every incident\Nhe was involved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.64,0:07:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I disapprove\Nof suicide more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, the boomerang it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dangerous toys are fun,\Nbut you could get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.56,0:08:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just no skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.46,0:08:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your bodyguard and ace\Ngunman, just as advertised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to play the hero,\Ncowboy? No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not as great as you might think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, gee. That's too bad.\NYou've got a flat tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well I guess you won't\Nbe escaping in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy do you have any idea what\Nyou're getting yourself into Mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This gentleman here is the one and\Nonly infamous humanoid typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was under the impression\Nthat he was a lot more handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you implying that I\Nam not Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.18,0:09:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a superb gunman,\Njust as the rumors claimed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and every incident he\Nwas in was swiftly...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,swiftly...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.91,0:09:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it so haphazardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could those incidents have been\Nanything but dumb luck any of them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still it is the unmistakable truth that he
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,solved each incident\Nwithout the use of his gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He absolutely refused to harm\Nanyone, even when citizens?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tried to kill him to collect\Nthe bounty on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can this be the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is! In here! Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Do you mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Momma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this keep happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm always in trouble and\Neverybody's always picking on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do, Momma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I crying in French?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he act the way he does?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only speculate, but\Nperhaps part of the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can be found in the testimony\Nof Miss Monica Allen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the left of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one person has to\Ndie to save this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, give yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand your situation\Nbetter than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.34,0:11:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please, sir, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I see this man you're after,\NI have no choice but to keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash was referring to when he\Nmentioned the man Monica was after?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so he finally took\Nhis gun into his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He pulled the trigger\Nfor the first time to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,save the very people who\Nhad tried to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, time's up, Gofsef!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw the fear of death into him, Gofsef!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you both\Nare still alive and well!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was kinda hoping you'd ditch\Nthe woman and save your own skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash wouldn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He isn't that kind of person!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.06,0:12:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you won't kill no matter what, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.70,0:13:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what, Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a damn hypocrite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you haven't had to kill\Ntroublemakers somewhere along the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.42,0:13:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because nobody can survive what you've\Nbeen through without hurting somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The $60 billion double dollar bounty\Non your head is proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you have to say\Nfor yourself, Vestas Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finally ready to fight, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you want to draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You felt it, twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Already, even your puny brain can realize\Nmy son's fist is a force to be reckoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:13:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or do you really believe\Nyou'll survive another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although no matter how fast you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.97,0:14:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,within the next few minutes\Nyou'll be smashing to tiny pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now pay attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because as a courtesy I'm going to lecture
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you on just what a stupid\Nfool you really are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using this technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human mincemeat special course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.91,0:14:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't have to quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy being a hero for a moment.\NThey've died in a most humiliating way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.37,0:15:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It changed course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It cost my son's fist to be off\Ncourse with six little bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could be my special one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! Did\Nyou see what he did? You
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really beat him and he did\Nit with only six bullets,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.79,0:16:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.65,0:16:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly it's become very clear to me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.57,0:16:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why he is called the Humanoid Typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually him, he's for real,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the legendary outlaw, Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, no matter what, I think\Nthis man is Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love and peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love and peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.97,0:16:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love and peace! Love and peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love and peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really fun to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.41,0:17:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.07,0:17:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time I observe his actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.45,0:17:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help but sense something\Nhidden deep within him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.69,0:17:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something we can't begin to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.39,0:17:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this much is certain\Neveryone who has become involved
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.23,0:17:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with him has somehow regained\Nan emotion which was once lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all right, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.23,0:17:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I've mentioned so many times before,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:17:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing beats Hardwon fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.65,0:18:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this point on, we're gonna go\Non living without relying on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.29,0:18:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice of you guys to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.79,0:18:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I still wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.65,0:18:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not the same man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.91,0:18:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can he possibly be the\Nreal Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The evil 60 billion double dollar outlaw\Nwith the fire of hell burning in his eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:19:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will pay, you will pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.97,0:19:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.87,0:19:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.97,0:19:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed all the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.25,0:19:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all dead, and you killed them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you were the one solely responsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it is your turn to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.37,0:19:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are so many sides to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is the real Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.11,0:19:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.09,0:19:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't sleep at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.81,0:19:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't someone tell him\Nto get out of this hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:19:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bash the stampede to get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.77,0:20:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So those scars are the price you paid for
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.41,0:20:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dealing with your opponents\Nwithout killing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not exactly something\NI like girls to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think many of them would run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.59,0:20:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I mean is they wouldn't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Vash, I've been meaning to\Nask you this for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't done anything wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yet terrible things keep\Nhappening to you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.49,0:20:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The townspeople look at you like\Nyou're some sort of criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:20:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you go on living this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems so awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't yet buried my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.73,0:21:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can live in peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.45,0:21:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I've come to terms with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm able to finally put it behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.29,0:21:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks, Sheriff, for\Nletting me go like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.57,0:21:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only doing it because I\Ndon't want you in my town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.39,0:21:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.37,0:21:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want you to get the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.19,0:21:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I Will do you plan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.61,0:21:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to follow him this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.85,0:22:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Course. I am. I have to.\NIt's my job. That's True.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.93,0:22:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.84,0:22:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't very well leave the\Ntwo of you alone together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.69,0:22:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I Suppose I better come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.23,0:22:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone ever tell you you're\Njust simply annoying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.31,0:22:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.75,0:22:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.73,0:22:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you travel all alone in the\Ndesert it can be very perilous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.93,0:22:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you act now you can hire your\Nvery own bodyguard free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.43,0:22:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my work is guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.43,0:22:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take my eyes off him for a\Nminute and he's at it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.05,0:22:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.88,0:22:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.79,0:22:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede, hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.05,0:22:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.45,0:22:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.41,0:23:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.49,0:23:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.40,0:23:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave my left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.65,0:23:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm looking at my eyes\Nand I'm looking at my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.53,0:23:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.11,0:23:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.63,0:24:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you only face forward, there\Nis something you will miss seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.19,0:24:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a virtue to devote oneself to something,\Nfirmly believing in one's own ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.51,0:24:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that does not mean it's alright to\Nbelittle the ideals or feelings of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.95,0:24:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you lead such a busy life, and you\Ndon't realize how your parents feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.75,0:24:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's only self-satisfaction it's all\Nright to stop every now and again
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.63,0:24:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you want a moment's rest if you\Nwant to feel what other people feel

